OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fevening, with rain moving in from the
OL,7,Fsouth and persisting for much of the
OL,8,Fnight. Rain becoming more sporadic in
OL,9,Fplaces by dawn. Winds easing slightly,
OL,10,Fbut remaining breezy along the coast.
OL,11,FFeeling chillier in rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain for much of the day, with some
OL,15,Fheavier bursts possible in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, when it is also expected to
OL,17,Fturn breezy. Becoming largely dry
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
