OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with sunny spells and
OL,7,Flight winds Thursday. Heavy and
OL,8,Fpersistent rain, accompanied by strong
OL,9,Fwinds Friday. Cloudy periods and
OL,10,Fmostly dry on Saturday, rain and
OL,11,Fturning windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
